  "title": "Finding Respite Care in Ohio: A Complete Guide for Family Caregivers",
  "summary": "Respite care services in Ohio can give family caregivers the break they need—without sacrificing safety or quality of care. This guide covers in-home respite, adult day services, and overnight options, plus how Medicaid waivers and other programs may help pay. Learn where to start, what to ask for, and how to connect with your local Area Agency on Aging.",
